    "q4-A": "Server definitions should be able to specifiy minimum pollinig interval.",
    "sources": "This and \"the cloud\" should move together into a new epic, `atmosphere`.  I'm thinking that the atmosphere spaces are a very close analogy and should be thoroughly investigated before we make our own parallel-but-not-quite-the-same service which we need to own.\n\nGoal is not that spell is holding people's data, but that people can hold their own data somewhere, so that's very compatible with atmosphere's goals.  If we don't have to deal with hosting content that is fantastic.  If we end up selling space as an atmosphere server, also great."
  },
